{"id":"11143a41c6eb3d02c52a5321446217e4d5a50b63","url":"https://www.leiphone.com/category/yanxishe/HIGpHGf3ko6B1osw.html","title":"吴恩达开源的OpenWorker，为什么「不 Work」了？ | 雷峰网","site_name":"TopHub","source":"Readhub · AI","byline":null,"excerpt":"指望 Agent 替人上班之前，它们还得自己先去上个班","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div>\n                                                <!-- 123 -->\n                        \n                        \n                                                \n                        <!-- AI影响因子 -->\n                        <!-- xhBPeYDbNuuRZkwy -->\n                                                <!-- AI影响因子 -->\n                        <!-- 正文内容 -->\n                        <section data-mpa-action-id=\"mmiwq6ij1i3r\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><img alt=\"吴恩达开源的OpenWorker，为什么「不 Work」了？\" data-ratio=\"0.55\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1000\" data-croporisrc=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/XqAicMdcoiafM3LAVTibbEXV3td65kI6UM9rcRjNoZYxN3EJFV7nPypGYumG34PpvoTyrUfg1wTWbeLsstYMR8Hy3PFVU5K3ia66y9ibsJpF041w/0?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg\" data-cropselx1=\"0\" data-cropselx2=\"546\" data-cropsely1=\"0\" data-cropsely2=\"307\" data-imgfileid=\"100257293\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20260901/6a968c67cfb0d.jpg\" src=\"https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20260901/6a968c67cfb0d.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90\"></section><section data-pm-slice=\"5 10 []\" data-mpa-action-id=\"mmix4tgk1t7p\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-data-temp-type=\"image\" mpa-data-temp-power-by=\"yiban.io\" data-mpa-template=\"t\" data-mid=\"\"><section><section><span><span data-mpa-action-id=\"mmix6wyl1l05\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">指望 Agent 替人上班之前，它们还得自己先去上个班（雷峰网<span>(公众号：雷峰网)</span>）</span></span></span></span></section><span data-mpa-action-id=\"mqgbkegzw9n\"></span><span data-mpa-action-id=\"mpmlbwxl8oz\"></span><span data-lark-record-data=\"{&quot;rootId&quot;:&qu